# System Diagrams for VoiceForge AI

Here are the diagrams you requested for your system design report. You can use these Mermaid codes in any Markdown viewer (like GitHub or Notion) or a tool like [Mermaid Live Editor](https://mermaid.live/) to export them as high-quality PNG/SVG images for your document.

## 4.2 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE DIAGRAM

```mermaid
graph TD
    %% VoiceForge AI High Level Architecture
    
    subgraph "Client Interface"
        UI[User / API Client]
        UI_TXT[Text Input] -.-> UI
        UI_AUD[Audio Input] -.-> UI
    end

    subgraph "Core Backend Services"
        subgraph "Text-to-Speech Engine (VITS2)"
            T_NORM[Text Normalizer]
            T_ENC[Transformer Text Encoder]
            MAS[Duration Predictor & Alignment]
            T_DEC[HiFi-GAN Vocoder]
            
            T_NORM --> T_ENC --> MAS --> T_DEC
        end

        subgraph "Speech-to-Text Engine (Conformer-CTC)"
            VAD[Energy-based VAD / Segmenter]
            FEAT[Audio Feature Extractor]
            S_ENC[Conformer Encoder Blocks]
            S_DEC[CTC Beam Search Decoder]
            
            VAD --> FEAT --> S_ENC --> S_DEC
        end
    end

    subgraph "Storage & Data Layer"
        CP[Model Checkpoints]
        DS[Training Datasets]
    end

    UI --> |Raw Text| T_NORM
    UI --> |Raw Audio| VAD
    
    T_DEC --> |Synthesized Audio| UI
    S_DEC --> |Transcribed Text| UI

    CP -.-> |Loads Weights| T_ENC
    CP -.-> |Loads Weights| S_ENC
    DS -.-> |Offline Training| Core Backend Services
```

---

## 4.3 WORKFLOW DIAGRAM

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    %% Combined Inference Workflow
    
    Start((Start)) --> Choice{Select Process}
    
    %% TTS Workflow
    Choice -->|Generate Audio| TTS_1[Receive Input Text string]
    TTS_1 --> TTS_2[Clean & Normalize Text]
    TTS_2 --> TTS_3[Convert Characters to IDs]
    TTS_3 --> TTS_4[Predict Rhythm via Duration Predictor]
    TTS_4 --> TTS_5[Synthesize Audio via HiFi-GAN]
    TTS_5 --> TTS_6[Apply Volume Normalization]
    TTS_6 --> TTS_7[Crossfade Segments for Long Text]
    TTS_7 --> TTS_End(((Output Audio WAV)))
    
    %% STT Workflow
    Choice -->|Transcribe Audio| STT_1[Receive Input Audio Stream]
    STT_1 --> STT_2[Resample to 16kHz & Mono Convert]
    STT_2 --> STT_3{Audio > 30s?}
    STT_3 -- Yes --> STT_4a[Split audio via VAD Chunking]
    STT_3 -- No --> STT_4b[Process entire audio block]
    
    STT_4a --> STT_5
    STT_4b --> STT_5
    
    STT_5[Extract 80-Mel & 3D Pitch Features]
    STT_5 --> STT_6[Downsample via Conv2D Subsampling]
    STT_6 --> STT_7[Extract Context via Conformer Layers]
    STT_7 --> STT_8[Decode Probabilities via CTC Beam Search]
    STT_8 --> STT_9[Merge Overlapping Text Chunks]
    STT_9 --> STT_End(((Output Transcript Text)))
```

